/// AttentionPackage projection
///
/// Purpose:
/// - Expose the Attention-owned package rail for Workspace/interface/package consumers.
/// - Keep `LayoutConfig` as the canonical layout topology root under the package boundary.
/// - Avoid collapsing package truth and layout semantics into one object.
projection AttentionPackage is_branchable {
    root attention.AttentionPackage

    attention.AttentionPackage::layout_configs
    attention.AttentionPackageLayoutConfig::layout_config LayoutConfig
}
